      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:25858:25860"
    },
    {
      "id": "105:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“饿坏了。做汉堡好吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:25860:25874"
    },
    {
      "id": "105:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "亚历克斯微笑着说，“当然。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:25874:25890"
    },
    {
      "id": "105:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你拖着包走向小屋开了门，伸进一只手摸着电灯开关，然后开了灯。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:25890:25922"
    },
    {
      "id": "105:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "亚历克斯朝里看了看，赞许地点了点头。“喔，看着挺舒服嘛。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:25922:25953"
    },
    {
      "id": "105:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "转到 327。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:25953:25962"
    }
  ]
}
